  "title": "Tim NeCastro to retire as president and CEO of Erie Insurance",
  "summary": "CEO search to begin immediately as NeCastro plans retirement at end of 2026 ERIE, Pa., Feb. 20, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Erie Insurance (Nasdaq: ERIE) today announced that Tim NeCastro will retire as president and chief executive officer on Dec. 31, 2026, concluding a 30-year career with the company,",
